    "text": "Ref No.: KADU/LAND/01/144/WS. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amendment by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the following land/ Servitude has been transferred to the Government for a public purpose.",
