    "text": "temporary building is available; Extent : 0.5514 Ha. Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mr. Manjula Palihena, Mr. P.D. Nalaka Palihena, Mrs. Shyamali Palihena. All persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connections to the aforesaid land/ servitude hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on 16.10.2025 at 9.30 a.m. at he Divisional Secretariat, Kaduwela. And Further you are hereby requested to notify me in writing in duplicate before 13.10.2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
